{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1 Duration:</strong> ~2 hours<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432680/extras/cb0f43ac64fd2bc415a5c35e16fdc8e1.poster.avif?t=1749371862\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432680/extras/cb0f43ac64fd2bc415a5c35e16fdc8e1.webm?t=1749371862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432680/extras/cb0f43ac64fd2bc415a5c35e16fdc8e1.mp4?t=1749371862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong><br>Immerse yourself in the post-apocalyptic world of Bifrostia, where mutants and robots coexist among the ruins of a lost technological civilization. Embark on a gripping adventure in Ilgrot \u2014 a rusty city governed by an Artificial Intelligence, where strange events are unfolding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One seemingly ordinary day, you discover a mysterious space shuttle with an unusual robot on board. Your journey will lead you to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the city,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery behind the robot and its origins,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why it is being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Interact with characters and the environment, solve puzzles and mini-games to unveil the secrets of this mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style:</strong><br>Enjoy hand-painted visuals that convey a retro-futuristic atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong><br>An ambient soundtrack with cyberpunk elements by Alexander Zhelanov enhances and deepens the game's atmosphere.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432680/extras/07c1c447ef570b6a9991d17e9f624653.poster.avif?t=1749371862\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432680/extras/07c1c447ef570b6a9991d17e9f624653.webm?t=1749371862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1432680/extras/07c1c447ef570b6a9991d17e9f624653.mp4?t=1749371862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dance King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/a1502ad8c9d053b7fe39ba8259c6ea2aa2e4313d.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/be7fa8bc6348c0fd60a251701acbb5eccbfea0c3.jpg"},{"name":"Full Set","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/8fd365f3c0999c5d406e872d6e46c287119affcd.jpg"},{"name":"Generosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/2eddf44439450bd5a12f7af00045d4d3c84ab09b.jpg"},{"name":"Satisfier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/ac0321d8b227fcda06ddccac1267f642b8159b27.jpg"},{"name":"Meloman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/a17fece3584861caa2663025f3fd4a328e10e04b.jpg"},{"name":"Avid gamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/185eb7090ebf9e707de8c0fea322812db06b0c9d.jpg"},{"name":"Fugitive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1432680/5055ccc62acf583722dbd6ce8cc881d6333e2548.jpg"},{"name":"Ballet","pat